    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "nj9u587",
      "content": "The eastern part of Goa is covered by the Western Ghats, a UNESCO World Heritage Site and one of the world's eight biodiversity hotspots. The forests provide critical ecosystem services and are home to rare flora and fauna.<img></img>"
    },
